[38;2;124;124;124mSo Z(p) = O(1) on average, and sum_{p ≤ N} Z(p) ~ 0.88 * π(N) ~ 0.88 * N / log [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mN.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThis means:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- Main term: N * sum_{p ≤ N} Z(p) * log p / (p-1) ~ N * C * log N (where C is [0m
[38;2;124;124;124msome constant related to the average of Z(p) * log p / p).[0m
